    "Backup is off until you enable it for this vault. While the vault is open, changes upload automatically. Reopen it to retry interrupted uploads. Keep your recovery phrase somewhere outside this phone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Backup ist zunächst ausgeschaltet. Bei geöffnetem Tresor werden Änderungen automatisch hochgeladen. Öffne ihn erneut, um abgebrochene Uploads zu wiederholen. Bewahre die Wiederherstellungsphrase außerhalb dieses Telefons auf."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backup is off until you enable it for this vault. While the vault is open, changes upload automatically. Reopen it to retry interrupted uploads. Keep your recovery phrase somewhere outside this phone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sauvegarde reste désactivée jusqu’à votre activation. Les changements sont envoyés lorsque le coffre est ouvert. Rouvrez-le pour réessayer un envoi interrompu. Conservez la phrase de récupération hors de ce téléphone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il backup è disattivato finché non lo abiliti. Le modifiche vengono caricate quando la cassaforte è aperta. Riaprila per riprovare i caricamenti interrotti. Conserva la frase di recupero fuori da questo telefono."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この保管庫で有効にするまでバックアップは行われません。保管庫を開いている間に変更を自動送信します。中断した場合は再度開くと再試行します。復元フレーズはこの端末以外に保管してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 보관함에서 켜기 전에는 백업하지 않습니다. 보관함이 열려 있으면 변경 사항을 자동 업로드합니다. 중단되면 다시 열어 재시도하세요. 복구 문구는 이 휴대폰 외부에 보관하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为此保险库启用后才会备份。打开保险库时会自动上传更改；上传中断后请重新打开以重试。请将恢复短语保存在此手机之外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
