    "Cloud backup and sharing are stopped on this device after a duress unlock." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nach dem Entsperren unter Zwang sind Cloud-Backup und Teilen auf diesem Gerät gestoppt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud backup and sharing are stopped on this device after a duress unlock."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le déverrouillage sous contrainte a arrêté la sauvegarde cloud et le partage sur cet appareil."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo sblocco sotto costrizione ha interrotto il backup cloud e la condivisione su questo dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊急用パターンで開いたため、この端末でのクラウドバックアップと共有は停止しています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "긴급 패턴으로 잠금을 해제하여 이 기기의 클라우드 백업과 공유가 중지되었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用胁迫图案解锁后，此设备已停止云备份和共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud backups are encrypted before upload. Only the recovery phrase used for the latest completed backup can open it. Your pattern alone cannot restore deleted files." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Backups werden vor dem Upload verschlüsselt. Du benötigst die Phrase des letzten abgeschlossenen Backups. Das Muster allein stellt gelöschte Dateien nicht wieder her."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloud backups are encrypted before upload. Only the recovery phrase used for the latest completed backup can open it. Your pattern alone cannot restore deleted files."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les sauvegardes sont chiffrées avant l’envoi. Seule la phrase de la dernière sauvegarde terminée permet de l’ouvrir. Le schéma seul ne restaure pas les fichiers supprimés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I backup vengono crittografati prima dell’upload. Serve la frase dell’ultimo backup completato. La sola sequenza non ripristina i file eliminati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バックアップは送信前に暗号化されます。最後に完了したバックアップの復元フレーズが必要です。パターンだけでは削除したファイルを復元できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "백업은 업로드 전에 암호화됩니다. 마지막으로 완료된 백업에 사용한 복구 문구가 필요합니다. 패턴만으로 삭제된 파일을 복원할 수는 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "备份会在上传前加密。只有最近一次完整备份所用的恢复短语才能打开它。仅凭图案无法恢复已删除的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
