    "Confirm your current pattern to save. Selecting a different dummy also requires its pattern. Enabling or removing Face ID protection requires a successful Face ID check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bestätige zum Speichern dein aktuelles Muster. Ein anderer Scheintresor erfordert auch dessen Muster. Zum Aktivieren oder Entfernen des Face-ID-Schutzes muss Face ID erfolgreich sein."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirm your current pattern to save. Selecting a different dummy also requires its pattern. Enabling or removing Face ID protection requires a successful Face ID check."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Confirmez votre schéma actuel pour enregistrer. Un nouveau coffre leurre exige aussi son schéma. Activer ou retirer Face ID exige une vérification Face ID réussie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conferma il segno attuale per salvare. Scegliendo un’altra cassaforte esca serve anche il suo segno. Per attivare o rimuovere Face ID occorre una verifica Face ID riuscita."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存するには現在のパターンを確認してください。別のダミー保管庫を選ぶ場合はそのパターンも必要です。Face ID保護の有効化・解除にはFace ID認証が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "저장하려면 현재 패턴을 확인하세요. 다른 위장 보관함을 선택하면 해당 패턴도 필요합니다. Face ID 보호를 켜거나 해제하려면 Face ID 인증에 성공해야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认当前图案以保存。选择其他伪装保险库还需要确认其图案。开启或移除 Face ID 保护都必须通过 Face ID 验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
