    "In Files, open Browse → iCloud Drive and select your saved .patternbackup file. Sign in to the same Apple Account and turn on iCloud Drive if it isn’t listed." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne in Dateien „Durchsuchen → iCloud Drive“ und wähle die gespeicherte .patternbackup-Datei. Fehlt iCloud Drive, melde dich beim selben Apple Account an und aktiviere es."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Files, open Browse → iCloud Drive and select your saved .patternbackup file. Sign in to the same Apple Account and turn on iCloud Drive if it isn’t listed."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Fichiers, ouvrez Parcourir → iCloud Drive et choisissez le fichier .patternbackup. S’il n’apparaît pas, connectez-vous au même compte Apple et activez iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In File, apri Sfoglia → iCloud Drive e seleziona il file .patternbackup salvato. Se manca, accedi allo stesso Apple Account e attiva iCloud Drive."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルで「ブラウズ」→「iCloud Drive」を開き、保存した.patternbackupファイルを選んでください。表示されない場合は同じApple AccountにサインインしてiCloud Driveを有効にしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "파일 앱에서 둘러보기 → iCloud Drive로 이동해 저장한 .patternbackup 파일을 선택하세요. 표시되지 않으면 같은 Apple 계정으로 로그인하고 iCloud Drive를 켜세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
