    "Keep an encrypted copy of this vault in your iCloud account. Photos, videos, folders, and names are encrypted before upload. Your recovery phrase is required to restore." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Speichere eine verschlüsselte Kopie in iCloud. Fotos, Videos, Ordner und Namen werden vor dem Upload verschlüsselt. Zur Wiederherstellung brauchst du die Wiederherstellungsphrase."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep an encrypted copy of this vault in your iCloud account. Photos, videos, folders, and names are encrypted before upload. Your recovery phrase is required to restore."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conservez une copie chiffrée de ce coffre dans iCloud. Photos, vidéos, dossiers et noms sont chiffrés avant l’envoi. La phrase de récupération est nécessaire pour restaurer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conserva una copia crittografata in iCloud. Foto, video, cartelle e nomi vengono crittografati prima dell’upload. Per ripristinare serve la frase di recupero."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この保管庫の暗号化コピーをiCloudに保存します。写真、動画、フォルダ、名前は送信前に暗号化されます。復元には復元フレーズが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 보관함의 암호화된 사본을 iCloud에 보관합니다. 사진, 동영상, 폴더, 이름은 업로드 전에 암호화됩니다. 복원하려면 복구 문구가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iCloud 中保存此保险库的加密副本。照片、视频、文件夹及名称都会在上传前加密。恢复时需要恢复短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep originals" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Originale behalten"
