    "Photos access is needed to delete originals. Allow access in Settings, or delete them in Photos. Your vault copies are safe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zum Löschen der Originale ist Fotozugriff nötig. Erlaube ihn in den Einstellungen oder lösche sie in Fotos. Deine Tresorkopien sind sicher."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Photos access is needed to delete originals. Allow access in Settings, or delete them in Photos. Your vault copies are safe."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’accès à Photos est nécessaire pour supprimer les originaux. Autorisez-le dans Réglages ou supprimez-les dans Photos. Les copies du coffre sont en sécurité."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Serve l’accesso a Foto per eliminare gli originali. Consenti l’accesso in Impostazioni o eliminali in Foto. Le copie nella cassaforte sono al sicuro."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オリジナルの削除には写真へのアクセスが必要です。設定で許可するか、写真アプリで削除してください。保管庫のコピーは安全です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "원본을 삭제하려면 사진 접근 권한이 필요합니다. 설정에서 접근을 허용하거나 사진 앱에서 삭제하세요. 보관함의 사본은 안전합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "删除原件需要“照片”访问权限。请在“设置”中允许访问，或直接在“照片”中删除。保险库中的副本是安全的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
