    "Save the phrase separately and wait for iCloud Drive to finish uploading before deleting Pattern. Deleting the app removes local vaults. Restoration needs both the backup file and its original phrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sichere die Phrase separat und warte vor dem Löschen von Pattern auf den abgeschlossenen iCloud-Drive-Upload. Das Löschen entfernt lokale Tresore. Zur Wiederherstellung brauchst du Backup-Datei und ursprüngliche Phrase."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save the phrase separately and wait for iCloud Drive to finish uploading before deleting Pattern. Deleting the app removes local vaults. Restoration needs both the backup file and its original phrase."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conservez la phrase séparément et attendez la fin de l’envoi sur iCloud Drive avant de supprimer Pattern. Les coffres locaux seront effacés. La restauration exige le fichier de sauvegarde et sa phrase d’origine."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salva la frase separatamente e attendi il caricamento completo su iCloud Drive prima di eliminare Pattern. L’eliminazione rimuove le casseforti locali. Servono file di backup e frase originale per ripristinare."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フレーズは別に保管し、iCloud Driveのアップロード完了を待ってからPatternを削除してください。アプリ削除でローカル保管庫も消えます。復元にはバックアップファイルと元のフレーズが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "문구를 별도로 저장하고 iCloud Drive 업로드가 완료될 때까지 기다린 후 Pattern을 삭제하세요. 앱을 삭제하면 로컬 보관함도 삭제됩니다. 복원하려면 백업 파일과 원래 문구가 모두 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请单独保存短语，并在 iCloud Drive 上传完成后再删除 Pattern。删除应用会移除本地保险库。恢复时必须同时具备备份文件及其原始短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save this phrase outside Pattern. Your previous phrase no longer recovers this vault. Existing backup files still use their original phrases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sichere diese Phrase außerhalb von Pattern. Die alte stellt diesen Tresor nicht mehr wieder her. Bestehende Backups nutzen weiterhin ihre ursprünglichen Phrasen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save this phrase outside Pattern. Your previous phrase no longer recovers this vault. Existing backup files still use their original phrases."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conservez cette phrase hors de Pattern. L’ancienne ne récupère plus ce coffre. Les sauvegardes existantes utilisent encore leurs phrases d’origine."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salva questa frase fuori da Pattern. La precedente non recupera più questa cassaforte. I backup esistenti usano ancora le frasi originali."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このフレーズをPatternの外に保存してください。以前のフレーズではこの保管庫を復旧できません。既存のバックアップには元のフレーズが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 문구를 Pattern 외부에 저장하세요. 이전 문구로는 이 보관함을 복구할 수 없습니다. 기존 백업 파일에는 원래 문구가 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在 Pattern 之外保存此短语。旧短语已无法恢复此保险库。现有备份仍使用各自的原始短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved only to this vault, never to Photos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wird nur in diesem Tresor gespeichert, nie in Fotos."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
