    "Send this phrase privately. Anyone who receives it before it is claimed can join. It will not be shown again after you leave this screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sende die Phrase vertraulich. Wer sie vor dem ersten Einlösen erhält, kann beitreten. Nach Verlassen dieses Bildschirms wird sie nicht erneut angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Send this phrase privately. Anyone who receives it before it is claimed can join. It will not be shown again after you leave this screen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Envoyez cette phrase en privé. Toute personne qui l’obtient avant son utilisation peut rejoindre le coffre. Elle ne sera plus affichée après avoir quitté cet écran."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Invia questa frase privatamente. Chi la riceve prima che venga riscattata può accedere. Non verrà più mostrata dopo aver lasciato questa schermata."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このフレーズは安全な方法で伝えてください。受け取られる前なら、フレーズを知る誰でも参加できます。この画面を離れると再表示されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 문구는 비공개로 전달하세요. 수락되기 전에 받은 사람은 누구나 참여할 수 있습니다. 이 화면을 떠나면 다시 표시되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请私下发送此短语。在被领取之前，任何收到它的人都能加入。离开此页面后将不再显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
