    "Set up a recovery phrase below before enabling iCloud backup." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Richte unten eine Wiederherstellungsphrase ein, bevor du das iCloud-Backup aktivierst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up a recovery phrase below before enabling iCloud backup."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Configurez une phrase de récupération ci-dessous avant d’activer la sauvegarde iCloud."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Configura una frase di recupero qui sotto prima di abilitare il backup iCloud."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudバックアップを有効にする前に、下で復元フレーズを設定してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud 백업을 켜기 전에 아래에서 복구 문구를 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用 iCloud 备份前，请先在下方设置恢复短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up a recovery phrase below, then save an encrypted backup to iCloud Drive. Local vaults are removed when you delete the app and aren’t included in device backups." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Richte unten eine Wiederherstellungsphrase ein und sichere dann ein verschlüsseltes Backup in iCloud Drive. Lokale Tresore werden mit der App gelöscht und sind nicht in Gerätebackups enthalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set up a recovery phrase below, then save an encrypted backup to iCloud Drive. Local vaults are removed when you delete the app and aren’t included in device backups."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Configurez une phrase ci-dessous, puis sauvegardez de façon chiffrée sur iCloud Drive. Les coffres locaux sont effacés avec l’app et exclus des sauvegardes de l’appareil."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imposta una frase qui sotto, poi salva un backup crittografato su iCloud Drive. Le casseforti locali vengono rimosse eliminando l’app e non sono incluse nei backup del dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下で復旧フレーズを設定し、iCloud Driveに暗号化バックアップを保存してください。ローカル保管庫はアプリ削除で消え、デバイスのバックアップには含まれません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "아래에서 복구 문구를 설정한 다음 iCloud Drive에 암호화된 백업을 저장하세요. 앱을 삭제하면 로컬 보관함도 삭제되며 기기 백업에는 포함되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先在下方设置恢复短语，再将加密备份保存到 iCloud Drive。删除应用会移除本地保险库，且本地保险库不包含在设备备份中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up a recovery phrase first. Keep it somewhere safe outside this app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Richte zuerst eine Wiederherstellungsphrase ein. Bewahre sie sicher außerhalb dieser App auf."
