            "value" : "설정에서 변경할 수 있습니다. 격자를 바꾸려면 모든 보관함에 새 패턴을 만들어야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可在设置中更改。更改网格需要为所有保险库创建新图案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a backup saved before the app was deleted and the recovery phrase used to encrypt it. A recovery phrase alone cannot restore deleted photos or videos." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du brauchst ein vor dem Löschen der App gespeichertes Backup und die zugehörige Wiederherstellungsphrase. Die Phrase allein kann gelöschte Fotos oder Videos nicht wiederherstellen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You need a backup saved before the app was deleted and the recovery phrase used to encrypt it. A recovery phrase alone cannot restore deleted photos or videos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il vous faut une sauvegarde antérieure à la suppression de l’app et sa phrase de chiffrement. Une phrase seule ne peut pas restaurer des photos ou vidéos supprimées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servono un backup salvato prima di eliminare l’app e la frase usata per crittografarlo. La sola frase non può ripristinare foto o video eliminati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリ削除前に保存したバックアップと、その暗号化に使った復旧フレーズが必要です。フレーズだけでは削除された写真や動画は復元できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱을 삭제하기 전에 저장한 백업과 암호화에 사용한 복구 문구가 필요합니다. 복구 문구만으로는 삭제된 사진이나 동영상을 복원할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你需要删除应用之前保存的备份，以及加密时使用的恢复短语。仅凭恢复短语无法恢复已删除的照片或视频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll return to the lock screen. Use the new patterns from now on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kehrst zum Sperrbildschirm zurück. Verwende ab jetzt die neuen Muster."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You’ll return to the lock screen. Use the new patterns from now on."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous reviendrez à l’écran verrouillé. Utilisez désormais les nouveaux schémas."
